{
  "file" : "npc/battleground/bg_common.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wise adventurer, why don't you lend us your power for victory?",
      "translation" : "睿智的冒險者，何不借助你的力量，助我們贏得勝利？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's the reason for the Battle?",
      "translation" : "為什麼要戰鬥？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about General Guillaume",
      "translation" : "告訴我吉約姆將軍的事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Maroll's great king, Marcel Marollo VII, is very sick lately.",
      "translation" : "馬羅爾偉大的國王馬塞爾·馬羅洛七世最近病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His Majesty has declared that he will be leaving the future of Maroll to me or the 3rd prince, General Guillaume.",
      "translation" : "陛下宣佈，他將把馬羅爾的未來交給我或三王子吉約姆將軍。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "General Guillaume may have an advantage in this battle as he is the great general of Maroll, but that doesn't automatically mean he'll win.",
      "translation" : "吉約姆將軍是馬羅爾的大將軍，在這場戰鬥中或許佔有優勢，但這並不代表他一定會贏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to win this battle so that I can bring prosperity to the people of Maroll. They've suffered enough from war...",
      "translation" : "我想贏得這場戰鬥，為馬羅爾的人民帶來繁榮。他們已經飽受戰爭之苦..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我願意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you so much. I feel like I can win with the help of adventurers like you.",
      "translation" : "非常感謝。有了像你這樣的冒險者相助，我覺得自己一定能贏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, please go downstairs and join your comrades in sharpening their skills to fight the enemy!",
      "translation" : "現在請到樓下，和同伴一起磨練戰鬥技巧，迎戰敵人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For Maroll!",
      "translation" : "為了馬羅爾！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 3rd Prince Guillaume is the great general of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "三王子吉約姆是馬羅爾的大將軍。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's a waste of time to explain to you how great a leader or warlord he is, since he commands the great military power of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "他統率著馬羅爾強大的軍隊，至於他是多麼出色的領袖或戰將，我就不必多說了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, there's something he and his followers are unaware of:",
      "translation" : "可惜，他和他的追隨者都沒有意識到一件事："
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do the people of Maroll really want them to spend so much money on military power?",
      "translation" : "馬羅爾的人民真的希望他們把這麼多錢花在軍力上嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We have suffered enough from wars.",
      "translation" : "我們已經受夠了戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I believe weapons aren't the best way to bring prosperity to a nation.",
      "translation" : "我相信，武器並不是讓國家繁榮的最佳途徑。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I do not wish to shed blood, but I have no choice but to fight for the possibility of peace and for the sake of my people.",
      "translation" : "我不願流血，但為了和平的可能，也為了我的人民，我別無選擇，只能戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我願意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you so much. I feel like I can win with the help of adventurers like you.",
      "translation" : "非常感謝。有了像你這樣的冒險者相助，我覺得自己一定能贏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, please go downstairs and join your comrades in sharpening their skills to fight the enemy!",
      "translation" : "現在請到樓下，和同伴一起磨練戰鬥技巧，迎戰敵人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克魯瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For Maroll!",
      "translation" : "為了馬羅爾！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hot-blooded adventurer, we need your ability to win this battle.",
      "translation" : "熱血的冒險者，我們需要你的本領來贏得這場戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's the reason for the Battle?",
      "translation" : "為什麼要戰鬥？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about Prince Croix",
      "translation" : "告訴我克魯瓦王子的事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Our great king, Marcel Marollo VII, is very sick lately.",
      "translation" : "我們偉大的國王馬塞爾·馬羅洛七世最近病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His Majesty has declared that he has chosen either me or Prince Croix as the next king amongst his 9 sons.",
      "translation" : "陛下已宣佈，在他的九個兒子中，他選擇了我或克魯瓦王子作為下一任國王。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Two kings can't share a nation! Only the one victorious from His Majesty's appointed battle will be enthroned.",
      "translation" : "一個國家不能有兩位國王！只有在陛下指定的戰鬥中獲勝的人才能繼承王位。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is, however, not just a battle between us. This battle will determine the future of this country.",
      "translation" : "然而，這不只是我們兩人之間的戰鬥。這場戰鬥將決定這個國家的未來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I pledge on my honor to prove that I'm the one who can protect this Maroll from outside threats.",
      "translation" : "我以榮譽起誓，證明自己才是能夠保護馬羅爾免受外敵威脅的人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我願意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to my army, comrade.",
      "translation" : "歡迎加入我的軍隊，戰友。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your eyes tell me that you're a soldier that I can trust.",
      "translation" : "從你的眼神中，我看得出你是值得信賴的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, go upstairs and apply for battle with your comrades.",
      "translation" : "現在上樓，和同伴一起報名參戰。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sure they'll welcome you whole-heartedly!",
      "translation" : "我相信他們一定會熱烈歡迎你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll be the one who will capture the flag!",
      "translation" : "我會親自奪下旗幟！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 5th Prince Croix is currently titled as the Prime Minister of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "五王子克魯瓦目前擔任馬羅爾的首相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He thinks all national matters of a nation can be discussed and determined on a desk,",
      "translation" : "他認為，一個國家的所有國事都可以坐在書桌前討論並決定，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and believes in peaceful co-existence with other countries.",
      "translation" : "並且相信國家之間可以和平共處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's too ignorant to admit that so-called peace is built on countless lives that are sacrificed in wars while normal citizens and upper classes can live, oblivious to the horrors that allow them to live that way.",
      "translation" : "他太過無知，不明白所謂的和平，是無數人在戰爭中犧牲換來的；普通百姓和上層人士卻能對這種生活背後的殘酷視而不見。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's too naive to understand the reality....",
      "translation" : "他太天真，根本不懂現實..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't leave Maroll to someone like him who lives in a dream!",
      "translation" : "我不能把馬羅爾交給一個活在夢裡的人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His unrealistic beliefs will drown this country in poverty and make the people weak. If he becomes the king, Maroll will never rest from the onslaughts of other countries.",
      "translation" : "他不切實際的信念會讓國家陷入貧困，使人民變得軟弱。他若成為國王，馬羅爾將永無寧日，只能不斷承受他國的侵襲。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to teach him what makes this small country so powerful and prosperous. It's military power!",
      "translation" : "我想讓他明白，這個小國為何如此強大繁榮。靠的就是軍力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to join your army!",
      "translation" : "我要加入你的軍隊！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
