      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, go upstairs and apply for battle from your comrades.",
      "translation" : "現在上樓，和同伴一起報名參戰。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sure they'll welcome you whole-heartedly!",
      "translation" : "我相信他們一定會熱烈歡迎你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆將軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
